// A weapon (`content::actors::WeaponSpec`): its damage, the turns it is
// wound up between aiming and the strike, the cells it covers (drawn with
// the wielder `@` facing up, each struck cell a digit in the order the
// swing goes through them, or all `x`), how it is swung (`Thrust` straight
// at the target, `Sweep` in an arc across the front, `Hook` out and pulled
// back, `reach` cells out; a thrust when not given) and the streak it
// leaves (an effect: `Swoosh` is `assets/effects/swoosh.ron`).
//
// The jab: the cell in front.
(damage: 1, windup: 1, swing: Thrust(reach: 0.55), streak: Swoosh, art: "
    x
    @
")
